# pemu-verify instruction counts v1
# Instruction counts at app_main, in instructions.
#
# These are the esp32sim figures of the oracle table (Passport Keys 7.02 M, official 9.94 M), to
# the precision that table states them. Our count under `fast` at CPI 1 is compared against them
# at plus or minus 2 %, informational only.
#
# Regenerate on the oracle host with `cargo xtask oracle counts --record`, which prints the
# command to run; a recorded file replaces this one at full precision and keeps this format.
pk app_main 7_020_000
official app_main 9_940_000
